DEPRECATED: `-fclash-no-prim-warn` is deprecated in favor of `-Wno-clash-dubious-primitive` and `-Wno-clash-non-synthesizable`. Correspondingly, the `opt_primWarn` field of `ClashOpts` has been replaced by `opt_warnings`, which holds the enabled/fatal state of all named warnings [#3306](https://github.com/clash-lang/clash-compiler/issues/3306).
